---
---
<section class="py-16 bg-[#fffcf0]">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl">
        <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-8 mb-16">
            <div class="flex-1 hidden md:block">
                <div class="H_border"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="px-8">
                <h1 class="H_shape text-center whitespace-nowrap">
                    發 Contact 訊
                </h1>
            </div>
            <div class="flex-1 hidden md:block">
                <div class="H_border"></div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
            <!-- Left: Info & Map -->
            <div class="space-y-8">
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-[40px] shadow-sm border border-[#fff4cb]">
                    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#2D2E33] mb-6 border-l-4 border-[#ffc04c] pl-4">
                        聯絡資訊
                    </h3>
                    <div class="prose prose-orange text-gray-600 space-y-4">
                        <p>
                            您可以在任何需要專業支持或有任何疑問時填寫此表格與我們聯繫；也可以填寫表格留下您的意見或反饋。
                        </p>
                        <p class="italic text-sm">
                            You may contact us by filling in this form any time you need professional support or have any questions. You can also fill in the form to leave your comments or feedback.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Map Placeholder -->
                <div class="rounded-[40px] overflow-hidden shadow-lg aspect-video bg-gray-200 relative group">
                    <iframe 
                        src="https://www.google.com/maps/embed?pb=!1m14!1m12!1m3!1d29505.419018445!2d120.489!3d22.6784!2m3!1f0!2f0!3f0!3m2!1i1024!2i768!4f13.1!5e0!3m2!1szh-TW!2stw!4v1706691234567!5m2!1szh-TW!2stw" 
                        width="100%" 
                        height="100%" 
                        style="border:0;" 
                        allowfullscreen="" 
                        loading="lazy" 
                        referrerpolicy="no-referrer-when-downgrade"
                        class="grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-500"
                    ></iframe>
                    <div class="absolute bottom-4 left-4 bg-white/90 backdrop-blur px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#ff9600] border border-[#ff9600]/20">
                        📍 澄視維度 - 服務區域
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right: Contact Form -->
            <div class="bg-white p-10 rounded-[50px] shadow-xl border border-[#fff4cb] relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[#fff4cb] -mr-16 -mt-16 rounded-full opacity-50"></div>
                
                <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#2D2E33] mb-8 relative">
                    線上發訊 <span class="text-[#ffc04c]">Message</span>
                </h3>

                <form class="space-y-6 relative">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 mb-2">姓名 Name*</label>
                        <input type="text" required class="w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffcf0] border border-[#ffecb3] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#ffc04c] text-[#2D2E33]" />
                    </div>
                    
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 mb-2">信箱 Email*</label>
                        <input type="email" required class="w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffcf0] border border-[#ffecb3] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#ffc04c] text-[#2D2E33]" />
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 mb-2">主旨 Subject*</label>
                        <input type="text" required class="w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffcf0] border border-[#ffecb3] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#ffc04c] text-[#2D2E33]" />
                    </div>

                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-bold text-gray-500 mb-2">訊息 Message*</label>
                        <textarea required rows="5" class="w-full px-5 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-[#fffcf0] border border-[#ffecb3] focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-[#ffc04c] text-[#2D2E33] resize-none"></textarea>
                    </div>

                    <div class="pt-4">
                        <button type="submit" class="w-full py-5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-[#ffc04c] to-[#ff9600] text-white font-bold text-lg shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl hover:scale-[1.02] transition-all flex items-center justify-center gap-3">
                            <span>傳送 Submit</span>
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="h-6 w-6" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3" />
                            </svg>
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<style>
    /* Custom animations or refinements */
    section {
        background-image: radial-gradient(#ffecb3 0.5px, transparent 0.5px);
        background-size: 30px 30px;
    }
</style>
